  "translation": "Bjalo a bolela Koreshe, kgoši ya Persia: Yahwe, Elohim wa magodimo, o mphile bogoši bohle ba lefase; gomme yena o ntšeditše go agela yena ntlo yage Yerushalayime, yeo e lego Yahuda. Ke mang gare ga lona, o tšwa go setšhaba sa gagwe sohle? Yahwe, Elohim wa gagwe, a be le yena, gomme a name.",
